      trigger_capability: "the field-projection arm of the optionality relation: extend optional_at_required_obligation_diags (src/v1/04_infer.dag) so a field read THROUGH an optional is decided at the PROJECTION position. That is the next-rung trigger already recorded by dag/gunbc/recurring_failure_mode/optional_admitted_where_a_required_value_is_declared.dag (receipt 2026-09-29, found by review 72657 on gunbc#12572; discriminating pair in test.claim.optional_field_read_admission_gap_witness: the same .first() read at a field position is admitted with zero blocking rows, at a call argument it refuses DeclaredTypeNotInhabited). OWNER BOUND AND NAMED, measured at main 10142523b00: the projection arm is claimed by roadmap row floor-optional-projection-wall (identity rn_MDGKH2UR7XGMNPT3AMWLAXVFO2, owner compiler-guarantee), rostered in the plan PR gunbc#17055 (head at measurement 0e786380ffec33eb893884e6bf8276229f2c3b00, roadmap_authority.dag:8226-8228; that ref moves, the identity does not). Its carriers, quoted verbatim from that row: src/v1/04_infer.dag, dag/test/claim/optional_field_read_admission_gap_witness.dag, and dag/gunbc/recurring_failure_mode/optional_admitted_where_a_required_value_is_declared.dag -- NOTE, corrected 2026-11-25 after re-reading the row: THIS row is NOT one of its carriers, an earlier draft of this string claimed it was. That row declares no dispatch field, so it is NotDispatchable until #16894 lands, and it is not on main yet (measured 2026-11-25: 0 occurrences of that identity in main's roadmap_authority, rc 1) - the wall therefore has an owner and a plan, and no permission to start yet. Its own red_control names the instrument already in the tree: fn class_blocking_count at dag/test/claim/optional_field_read_admission_gap_witness.dag:27 returns 0 blocking rows for the projection fixture, which is what makes this probe pair the measurement of the gap and that row the owner of the fix. HOW THE OWNER WAS FOUND, kept because the absence was the finding: at main 25f66b6a844 no roadmap row claimed the projection position - optional-admitted-at-record-literal-field (rn_50P0GN3GQK5MSVMMKCZWWZ8YE5) disclaims it in out_of_scope and takes the field-DECLARATION position, and cardinality-optional-declaration (rn_X9MHZ7FXWXKKS32YBXJASTZJM5) is the T?-versus-explicit-Optional declaration-name class, not a read at the projection. On that wall landing, the hole witness floor_cardinality_seam_field_projection_through_optional_is_still_silent is re-ranked to a regression control beside its discriminating call-argument refusal." as NonEmptyStr,
